<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts Henkel as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-CSFB starts Henkel as hold.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>German consumer products and chemicals group Henkel KGAa was rated &quot;hold&quot; as CS First Boston started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Analyst Penny Tattersall at CSFB said a strategic restructuring at Henkel should boost the company's earnings but the scope of this was already reflected in the company's share price.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
